# Trivy suppression baseline — recorded 2026-10-24 (F-09)
#
# The filesystem scan (severity HIGH,CRITICAL; ignore-unfixed) is enforced in
# CI from this date: it fails the workflow instead of running advisory.
# This file starts empty: no suppression is carried over from the advisory
# period. The first hosted run of the enforced scan establishes the baseline;
# if it reports findings, they are fixed or recorded here as reviewed
# exceptions with the four fields below.
#
# Adding a line here is a reviewed exception, not a fix. Every entry needs:
#   1. the finding ID,
#   2. an owner,
#   3. an expiry date, and
#   4. the reason (upstream fix pending, not reachable in this deployment, or
#      an accepted risk with a written decision).
# Trailing expiry dates are reviewed; entries without an owner and a date are
# rejected. Remove an entry as soon as the underlying cause is resolved.
